sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant I as Authorization Server
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant S as Service

  C->>I: Obtain access token (flow adapté)
  I-->>C: access_token (JWT)
  C->>G: Call API + Bearer token
  G->>G: Validate signature, iss, aud, exp
  G->>S: Forward request (claims minimales)
  S-->>G: Response
  G-->>C: Response
